Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.13,0:01:07.82,Title,0,0,0,0,,《大白鲨2》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.55,0:03:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.98,0:05:42.24,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿米堤奖学基金启动舞会）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.30,0:05:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你到哪里去了？- 耽搁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where have you been? - Delayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.63,0:05:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 对我来说是件大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I figured. This is a big deal for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.34,0:05:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩卓拿走了吉普车钥匙 我找不到备用的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hendricks had the keys to the Jeep. I couldn't find the spares.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.21,0:05:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,装作你一直在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, act as if you've been here the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.09,0:06:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么装？- 不耐烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How? - Look bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢阿米堤高中乐队 精彩的表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you Amity High School Band for that eloquent selection.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.38,0:06:09.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很高兴 继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're happy, once again…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.09,0:06:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈 麦克拒绝跟我讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mama, Michael won't talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.21,0:06:14.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这里干什么？- 施太太没有来 没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing here? - Mrs Silvera couldn't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.42,0:06:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请今年的阿米堤小姐韦迪娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now this year's Miss Amity, Tina Wilcox,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.16,0:06:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,为这座新酒店正式剪彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}will cut the ribbon, officially opening this luxurious new hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.84,0:06:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这株摇钱树 是由海滩公寓的建筑者\N{\fnArial\fs30}This money tree is donated by Len Peterson,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,兰尼一皮德逊捐赠\N{\fnArial\fs30}the builder of Amity Shores Condominiums,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.38,0:06:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,以此作为对社区的回馈\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a gesture of goodwill.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.50,0:06:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在恭请兰尼先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's hear it for Len.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.09,0:06:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 兰尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Len.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.59,0:06:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千五百美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}$1, 500.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.31,0:07:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,捐赠给阿米堤奖学基金\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a special gift to the Amity Scholarship Fund.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.88,0:07:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪娜 来 剪彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, Tina, cut it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.25,0:07:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atta girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.13,0:07:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在再请阿米堤高中乐队表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now the Amity High School Band once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.92,0:07:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,平台上有茶点招待各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Refreshments on the patio, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.92,0:07:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 孩子 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, boy. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.88,0:07:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,布迪 你好啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brody, how are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.67,0:07:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 马丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.34,0:07:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说讲演真精彩 - 莱瑞 棒极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I think it went well. - Hell of a speech, Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.46,0:07:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 捐赠绝对正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right on the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.21,0:07:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢 见过我儿子了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Have you met my son Larry?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.59,0:08:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 莱瑞 你过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Larry Jr. Larry, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.71,0:08:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟兰尼打个招呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. Say hello to Len.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.05,0:08:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 - 嗨 莱瑞\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How you doing? - Hi, Larry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.05,0:08:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多漂亮的孩子 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice-looking boy. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.09,0:08:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱伦 看看酒吧开了没有 别怠慢了客人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen, make sure that the bar is open and everyone's taken care of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.00,0:08:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.57,0:08:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 真了不起的女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir, a fantastic lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.39,0:08:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有她我不知道会怎么样 - 真的？我也是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't know what I'd do without her. - Really? Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.97,0:08:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你表妹多大？- 十七 是高中生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How old is your cousin? - 17. She's a senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.60,0:08:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢不认识约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not crazy about blind dates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果她们屁股和胸脯 长得不错也无妨\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're OK if they got little white canes and tin cups.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.39,0:08:41.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真恶心！- 真讨厌！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's awful! - Ah, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.76,0:08:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你妈安排的吗？- 对 这是她的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did your mom put all this together? - Yeah, it's her job.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.55,0:08:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 饮料是她调配的吗？- 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did she make the punch? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.35,0:08:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好 真难喝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, it's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.51,0:09:23.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你有舞伴吗？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get your dance? - Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我也没有 - 你打算邀请谁呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me neither. - Who you gonna ask next?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.35,0:09:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,韦迪娜 阿迪的女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tina Wilcox. Ed's girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.43,0:09:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.55,0:09:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,问一声也无妨 有时美女也很寂寞\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't hurt to ask. Sometimes beautiful girls are the loneliest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.60,0:09:41.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直是胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a crock of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.72,0:09:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.10,0:09:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,到泽西海滩这是 第四还是第五晚上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it the fourth or fifth night at the Jersey shore?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.80,0:09:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,第四晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}The fourth!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我以为你不尊重我 - 我尊重！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought you wouldn't respect me. - I did! I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.89,0:10:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出去好吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we get out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.93,0:10:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？出去逛逛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? To fool around?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.64,0:10:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么不？- 听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not? - You're on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.35,0:11:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个水管沾满了贝壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}This pipe has more barnacles than you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.60,0:11:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？我告诉你！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? I told you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.35,0:11:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫到你左边儿！另一边儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brush it off to your left! Your other left.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.76,0:11:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你今天休假\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were off duty.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.39,0:11:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 上午是我个人的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning! Till noon I'm on my own time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.35,0:11:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 警长！- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Chief! - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.64,0:11:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在主航道发现了一艘大游艇\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a gold plater in the main channel, a big cruiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.47,0:12:01.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在哪里？- 在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Whereabouts? - Off the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.80,0:12:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有灯光 只有潜水旗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No running lights, just the diver's flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.14,0:12:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要我去看看吗？- 你可以吗？我开不了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Want me to run out there? - Would you? I can't run this thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.72,0:12:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 乐意前往 - 办公室见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Happy to do it. - I'll see you back at the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.89,0:12:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,带这老头子一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the old man of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.89,0:12:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,先解船头缆 再解尾缆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cast off the bowline, and then the stern line,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.60,0:12:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后解侧缆\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then cast off the spring line.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.47,0:12:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.85,0:12:26.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只逗留几分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll only be here for a few minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.55,0:12:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我可以跟你一起去吗？- 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can't I come with you? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.97,0:12:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他可以跟我去 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He can come with me. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.26,0:12:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行？- 不行 下船\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No? - No. Off the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.05,0:12:36.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他起码可以帮助我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can help me, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.80,0:12:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好！好兄弟！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boo! Big brothers!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.51,0:12:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚 你驶过船吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sean, ever been an anchor before?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.14,0:12:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克 嗨 - 要出海吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mike, hi. - You going out now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.01,0:12:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 好 你可以见见我表妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Good, you can meet my cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.43,0:12:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我会见到她的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I'll meet her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.47,0:12:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,汤姆 回头见 周四同样时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, Tom, see you later. Same time Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.05,0:13:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿迪 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andy, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.26,0:13:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,回头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you guys later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.76,0:13:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么啦？- 不怎么啦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the problem? - What isn't?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.68,0:13:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,布露！布露\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brooke!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.51,0:13:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackie, hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.80,0:13:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说 她是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick, quick, who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.60,0:13:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我堕入爱河了！- 那个表妹 我希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm in love! - The cousin, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.39,0:13:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真幸运 幸运…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucky, lucky, lucky, lucky…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.80,0:13:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见她看你的眼神吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see the way she looked at you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.26,0:13:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她想得到你 - 她不是在看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She wants you. - She wasn't looking at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.43,0:13:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？她看着你直流口水\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? She was staring at you and drooling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.72,0:13:38.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我又瘦又戴眼镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm thin, I wear glasses,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.89,0:13:41.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我住在阿米堤岛多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I live in Amity Island year round.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.35,0:13:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我配不上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not good enough for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.93,0:13:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对 她也许不是在看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right, she probably wasn't looking at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.51,0:13:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱瑞 你看 莱瑞 看！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry, look. Larry, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.93,0:13:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 你看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.76,0:13:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.18,0:14:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯？- 她的乳头像个麻雀\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well? - She's got tits like a sparrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.72,0:14:04.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么能这样说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have to talk like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.85,0:14:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁 我妈妈？打开主帆\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you, my mother? Undo the jib.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.93,0:14:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们去驾船 - 驾船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're going sailing. - Sailing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.22,0:14:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要你认识这个人 他很帅\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 我在走！他在晒他的脚底板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look, I'm walking!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.80,0:15:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.97,0:15:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,道格拉斯！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Douglas!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.97,0:15:17.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能看新闻 球赛 甚至连电影也不能看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't watch the news, a ball game, can't even watch a movie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.14,0:15:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,只听到那些孩子通话器的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I hear is that kid and his radio going "breaker, breaker".
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.18,0:15:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽力而为的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try but it's under federal jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.39,0:15:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,但受到联邦法例管制\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.47,0:15:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知联邦调查局一个个来 你俩跟布莉谈 你跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}One at a time. You two talk to Polly, you come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.68,0:15:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 金雷丝怎么啦？- 她的卧室窗户对着我儿子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's this about Grace Kinny? - Her bedroom window faces my son's.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.18,0:15:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,她勾引他 裹着毛巾跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's teasing him, dancing around in a towel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.30,0:15:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳舞？韩卓，这边走 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dancing? Hendricks, good. Right this way. Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.85,0:15:49.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,来看看这个九零八\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in here and check out this 908.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.26,0:15:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么九零八？我从来没听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hel"s a 908? I never heard of a 908.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.22,0:15:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,九零八是帮我脱身的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}908 means get me out of there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.18,0:15:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么 - 游艇潜水员的摄影机\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's that? - Diver's camera from the cruiser.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.30,0:16:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,弃置的游艇！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the abandoned cruiser!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.43,0:16:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自罗德岛的富家子弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rich guys from Newport, Rhode Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.93,0:16:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我有艘价值十万的游艇 我不会丢弃的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had a $100, 000 boat, I wouldn't abandon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.89,0:16:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你有一艘 那就会被人调查的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you had one, there'd be an investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.72,0:16:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真风趣 - 她令我儿子神魂颠倒！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Very funny. - It's driving my boy to distraction!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.97,0:16:15.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去调查一下儿跳舞 - 跳舞？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dancing! Check out this dance. - Dance?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.30,0:16:41.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还可以再上去吗？- 让他上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I go back up? - Take it back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.05,0:16:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,上去 麦克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, back up, Mike!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 缠住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, it's twisted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.14,0:17:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉上来 麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull it up, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.14,0:17:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在你下面 麦克 - 现在放下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Underneath you, Mike. - Drop it down now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.68,0:17:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.68,0:17:49.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.64,0:18:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉下来！麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull down, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.05,0:18:45.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天气继续温暖晴朗\N{\fnArial\fs30}'The weather continues to be warm and clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.43,0:18:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,请接着收听全日音乐节目，新英格兰摇滚乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Back to the 24- hour music from Plymouth, the rock of New England. '
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.30,0:18:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 休息一会儿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, take a break for a minute, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.76,0:18:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪娜 你去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tina… where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.97,0:19:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.51,0:19:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿迪 来 我们去滑水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, come on, let's go sking.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.64,0:19:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 我们可以用我叔叔的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - We can use my uncle's boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.39,0:19:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,下周去 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll do it next week, OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.05,0:19:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总爱推到下周\N{\fnArial\fs30}With you everything is next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.51,0:21:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terry?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.30,0:21:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terry?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.26,0:21:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terry?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.18,0:22:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.89,0:22:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.39,0:22:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}God!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.14,0:22:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找不到任何人 一定在海底或漂走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't find anyone. They must have gone to the bottom and drifted.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.60,0:23:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,目击者见到一人驾船 一人滑水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witnesses say there was one person in the boat and one water-sking.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.60,0:23:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你说 这里什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}'I told you, there's nothing here. '
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.10,0:23:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你继续搜索\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to try dragging.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.26,0:23:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜索多久？浪很急 天也快黑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For how long? The current's moving everything and it'll be dark soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.60,0:23:16.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管 我要你呆到查出结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care, I want you to stay on it as long as it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.68,0:23:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,十、四\N{\fnArial\fs30}10-4.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.89,0:23:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们听到一声巨响 接着看到一股黑烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We heard a noise like a boom. Then there was this cloud of smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.97,0:23:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,爆炸了 一分钟前 还好好的 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The explosion. One minute they were having a wonderful time, the next…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.97,0:23:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道是怎么爆炸的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've no idea what could have caused it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.85,0:23:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道是什么引起的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what could have done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.72,0:23:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是游客吗？- 不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Were they off islanders? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.85,0:24:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以走了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we go now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.18,0:24:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.01,0:24:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,布迪警长 可以走了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief Brody, can we go, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.26,0:24:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以 谢谢 迪娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, thank you, Tina.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.22,0:24:35.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在这里搜索几遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been over this a dozen times.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.55,0:24:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.14,0:24:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还要呆多久？- 直到有所发现为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How much longer? - Until we find something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.18,0:24:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很冷 无聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm cold, bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.47,0:24:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无聊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}YOU'RE bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.72,0:24:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.10,0:24:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}George!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.18,0:25:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 很重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus, this is heavy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.39,0:25:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒霉 放下它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, shit. Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.51,0:25:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么？- 是电缆 放下它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is it? - Drop it. It's a power line.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.01,0:25:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太棒了！- 我们解开它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Terrific - Let me untangle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.47,0:25:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让全岛断电\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't want a power blackout.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.97,0:25:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁没发生什么前离开吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go before we do find something.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.76,0:26:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你第三支烟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's your third smoke already.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.10,0:26:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就着咖啡 - 吃个甜饼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- With coffee. - Try a donut.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.26,0:26:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要吃杂果圈 - 吃奇乐饼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want Froot Loops. - Eat Cheerios.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.01,0:26:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃奇乐饼 我吃杂果圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You eat Cheerios, I want Froot Loops.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.30,0:26:17.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃奇乐饼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You eat Cheerios.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.68,0:26:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们今天干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you guys up to today?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.55,0:26:22.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我去驾船 - 又去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going sailing. - Again?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.01,0:26:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还能做什么？- 那个工作怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What else is there to do? - What about that job?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.05,0:26:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的要工作吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have to?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.18,0:26:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不必工作 现在是假期\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't have to. It is his vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.14,0:26:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的记事本放在哪里了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did I leave my date book?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.55,0:26:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 各位今天这么早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning. Everybody's up early today.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.39,0:26:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.60,0:26:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多 这孩子十七岁了 我们说过要他找个工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lots. This kid is 17. We've talked about him getting a job before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.85,0:26:51.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 希望你能花点儿时间陪他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. I wish you could spend some time with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.51,0:26:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么可以呢？有宗船只意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can I? I've got a boat accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.76,0:26:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只有三名下属 一个迷于警艇的副手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've only got three cops and a deputy in love with the police launch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.72,0:27:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在又有宗案子 每个人都迷恋驾船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here's another one. Everybody's a boat freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.93,0:27:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个岛屿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an island.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.80,0:27:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我走了 - 等一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going. - Hold it. Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.26,0:27:15.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,风浪太大就别出去得太远 已经有不少麻烦了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go out too far if it's rough. We've had a lot of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.85,0:27:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 回头见 - 要小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK. See you later. - Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.10,0:27:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.72,0:27:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪娜 回来 - 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tina, come back here. - Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.80,0:27:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把帽子还给我 - 不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give me my hat. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.05,0:27:30.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回来 迪娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Tina!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.01,0:27:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come back here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.80,0:27:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白他们怎么出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder why they decided to move.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.18,0:27:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 灯塔内太热了 - 他俩会嫌热？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Too hot in the lighthouse? - Too hot for those two?!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.55,0:28:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.26,0:28:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,一接到消息我马上通知了你 听说伤口确实很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}I called you as soon as I heard. I hear the bites are really big.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.43,0:28:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先看看再说吧 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- After we've looked, we'll talk. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.14,0:28:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.72,0:28:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,请大家退后一点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you move back, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.64,0:28:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们透透气吧 请退后一点儿 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move back. Please just move back. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.01,0:28:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.55,0:28:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.68,0:28:51.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,按步就班吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}First things first.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.80,0:28:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,先量鼻翼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tip of the snout, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.43,0:29:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 七米半 - 七米半？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OK. Seven and a half meters. - Seven and a half meters?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.43,0:29:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.93,0:29:23.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 检查伤口的大小 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Check the bite radius. - The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.39,0:29:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 口的形状 - 鲸鱼的口？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The shape of the mouth. - Whale's mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.80,0:29:29.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲨鱼的口 - 什么鲨鱼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shark's mouth. - What shark?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.10,0:29:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,咬它的鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}The shark that did this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.26,0:29:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们并不知道 对不对？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know that, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.51,0:29:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这正是我们来调查的原因 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's what we're here to find out. - And we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.89,0:29:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你声音太小我听不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hear you if you whisper.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.97,0:29:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百一十一厘米\N{\fnArial\fs30}111 centimetres.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.76,0:29:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,六十八\N{\fnArial\fs30}68.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.93,0:29:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对鲨鱼有一定的经验\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had some experience with sharks.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.47,0:29:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.14,0:29:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看是大白鲨干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And I think a great white might have done this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.97,0:29:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大白鲨？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carcharodon carcharias? - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.14,0:30:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会想到这里有大白鲨？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think there might be one in these waters?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.89,0:30:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显这条鱼是被大鱼咬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's obvious a big fish took a bite out of this big fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.89,0:30:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是甫乳类动物 不是鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a mammal, not a fish.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.51,0:30:11.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,别吹毛求疵了 是不是鲨鱼咬的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't quibble! Is it a shark bite or isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.60,0:30:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.01,0:30:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这是条逆戈鲸\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is a killer whale.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.68,0:30:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个鲨鱼一定不小\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would have to be a shark of considerable size.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.35,0:30:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道血会吸引鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know sharks are attracted by blood and thrashing about.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.05,0:30:28.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}And sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.64,0:30:30.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,声音？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.14,0:30:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,声音 像声纳或雷达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound, like sonar or radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.22,0:30:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们喜欢不寻常不规律的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}They hone in on unusual, irregular sounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.43,0:30:38.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,有节奏和低频率的震动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any rhythmic, low-frequency vibration.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.22,0:30:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那附近可能有一条？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there could be one around?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.26,0:30:44.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不一定 可能是在别处受伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not necessarily. These wounds could have been inflicted out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.89,0:30:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有马上死 浪把它带到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}None were immediately fatal. The currents could have carried it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.14,0:30:53.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今年浪很大 - 去照顾人群吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We got a hell of a tide. - Just take care of the crowd!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.10,0:30:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.18,0:30:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,韩卓先生 请记下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Hendricks, take this down, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.30,0:31:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 今天不准出海 - 我们是驾船来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No more sailing today, OK? - We came out in my boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.93,0:31:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安迪会驶回去的 - 我有约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Andy'll take it back. - I got a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.35,0:31:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她会明白的 - 她不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She'll understand. - She won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.76,0:31:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 让我清静一下 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, give me a break, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.80,0:31:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是大白鲨就是另一条逆戈鲸\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's either a great white or another killer whale.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.64,0:31:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道是哪个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to know which.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.68,0:31:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,很难根据这个尸体下结论\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's impossible to tell with that body.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.35,0:31:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,它已经在此十二个小时了 至少在海上漂泊了一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The anima"s been ashore for 12 hours and drifting for a day at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.76,0:31:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,海中的小鱼也咬过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every nibbler in the sea's taken a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.10,0:31:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道海豚会发讯号联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know dolphins communicate. I mean, they send signals.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.97,0:31:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果一个鲨鱼被害 另一个会不会来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a shark was destroyed, could another shark come and…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.39,0:31:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲨鱼不像人懂得报复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharks don't take things personally, Mr Brody.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.26,0:31:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 我能… - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad, can I… - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.01,0:31:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我把船驶回去栓在码头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, I'll take it back and tie it up at the docks.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.85,0:32:00.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 再见 麦克 - 对不起 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bye, Mike. - I'm sorry. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.35,0:32:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明天见 - 我很感激 多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll see you tomorrow. - I appreciate it. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.55,0:32:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱瑞 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry. Larry, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.93,0:32:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要处理租赁的事情 看来今夏的生意会不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm showing summer rentals, I think we have a good season going for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.97,0:32:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 但我想单独跟你谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swell. But I have to talk to you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.51,0:32:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.85,0:32:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能又有个鲨鱼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We may have another shark problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.76,0:32:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是认真的？- 我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you serious? - You bet I'm serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.55,0:33:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙滩上发现被吃掉一半的鲸鱼 还有两人失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got a half-eaten whale on the beach, got two persons missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.14,0:33:05.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条鲸鱼被咬掉了这么大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whale's got a bite out of it this big.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.76,0:33:08.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人看到鲨鱼 你现实点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one has seen a shark. Be realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.43,0:33:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,应当通知议员 虽然只是种感觉 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The selectmen should know about it. It's just a feeling, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.10,0:33:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱瑞 不仅是这个 还…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry, I not only have this attack but I've got…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.51,0:33:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有两个滑水… - 是个悲剧 船事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I've got two water-skiers… - A tragedy, but a boating accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.97,0:33:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有鲨鱼 是个意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}No fin, no sharks. A boating accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.76,0:33:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可仍没找到他们 - 很多人死在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're both still missing. - We have a lot of deaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.55,0:33:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,找不到尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}that never turn up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.39,0:33:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都被鲨鱼吃了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they all shark victims?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.64,0:33:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.89,0:33:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 胡说 - 胡说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bullshit. - Bullshit?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.97,0:33:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,海滩上的鲸鱼伤口大是胡说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it bullshit I got a whale with a bite in it this big?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.68,0:33:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当我是傻瓜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What am I? An ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.47,0:33:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你通知我时 我通知了爱伊琴和她上司\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you called me, I called Elkins and her bosses.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.85,0:33:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不能证明有鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing she saw is proof of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.85,0:33:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们不会采取行动？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're not going to do anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.18,0:34:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁，这次就不要勉强了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martin, don't press it this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.72,0:34:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回去工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've got to get back to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.30,0:34:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 但你要记住今天的谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, Larry, but you just remember this conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.55,0:34:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要记住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just remember it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.35,0:37:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.85,0:37:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.97,0:37:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chief?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.93,0:37:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,在殡仪馆找不到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Missed you at the funeral home.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.64,0:37:56.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,山度说你在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santos said you'd be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.01,0:38:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊，克雷 一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Christ, what a mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.14,0:38:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没猜错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't miss much.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.68,0:38:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,身份证明了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Positive ID?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.35,0:38:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是船上那个女人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're pretty sure it was the woman aboard the boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.97,0:38:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.14,0:38:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢接线员 请继续试接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, operator. Just keep trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.35,0:38:39.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 两名潜水员有消息吗？- 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anything new on those two divers? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.68,0:38:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 应当阻止游客去… - 你看过那些东西了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We should keep sightseers… - Did you look at that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.60,0:38:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 这部摄影机呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - How about that camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.01,0:38:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 里面可能有线索 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Might be something in it. - Yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.89,0:38:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 送去冲洗 - 明早就去办\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Take it to get developed. - First thing in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.64,0:38:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为啥现在不去？- 太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why not now? - It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.14,0:39:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,克雷 我吃饭要晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Christ, I'm late for dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.55,0:39:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在等一个长途电话 叫他打到我家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm expecting a long distance call. Send it to the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.43,0:39:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.39,0:39:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我能听到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I can hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.97,0:39:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我会通知他的 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'll give him the message. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.76,0:39:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,找我的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.26,0:39:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 爸爸 - 嗨 小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, Dad. - Hi, gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.55,0:39:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 是曼胡珀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, sort of. Matt Hooper.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.97,0:39:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在南极洲澳罗拉研究船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's on a vessel in the Antarctic.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.17,0:39:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,明春之前无法电讯联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}and won't be in radio range till spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.30,0:39:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我曾给他打过电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I gave him a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.85,0:39:50.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martin?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.72,0:39:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martin?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.18,0:39:55.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.85,0:39:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你情绪很低 今天去哪儿了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a mess. Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.35,0:40:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,去山度那儿了 在海里找到了个尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over at Santos', I dragged a body out of the ocean today.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.43,0:40:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道怎么回事了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you any idea what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.60,0:40:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.64,0:40:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,山度认为是船意外的遇害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Santos thinks it might be a victim from the boat accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.22,0:40:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想谈谈此事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you wanna talk about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.35,0:40:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,像往常一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just routine.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.68,0:40:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.26,0:40:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 过来一下儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mike, come here a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.35,0:40:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.89,0:40:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明天有事要你做 - 我已经有安排了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something for you to do tomorrow. - I kinda had plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.22,0:40:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,出海？不行 你不能出海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sailing? Forget it. You're grounded. Beach, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.39,0:40:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 海滩 只能在海滩 - 别这样 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Dad. - I talked to John.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.64,0:40:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟阿章说了 他沙滩有份工作你干到开学\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a job till you go back to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.14,0:40:45.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个暑假\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.55,0:40:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想工作 现在有了 我要那条船离开水面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wanted a job, now he's got one. And I want that boat out the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.22,0:40:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 爸爸 我能… - 明天晚上 我是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad, can I…? - Tomorrow night. And I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.82,0:42:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,人都到齐了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now… Everybody here?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.82,0:42:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 差不多 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just about. - OK, terrific.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.40,0:42:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友们 这是本镇的海滩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Folks, this is the town beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.53,0:42:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,开发区自然有其独自的通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The development, naturally, has its own private access,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.94,0:42:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想让大家看看它的特区\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I wanted you to see the concession area.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.98,0:42:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这里的沙粒 像砂糖一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look at the sand. It's like sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.36,0:42:48.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.19,0:42:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏季落日时\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the summertime, at sunset,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.15,0:42:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,海滩美不胜收\N{\fnArial\fs30}the whole beach looks incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.32,0:42:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直令人心旷神怡\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can be absolutely breathtaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.45,0:43:01.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会发现这个站台很有意思 我们很骄傲…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find this little bandstand interesting. We take pride in this…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.66,0:43:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 推销更多的好生活？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Selling more of the good life?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.16,0:43:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 这里一块 那里一块 - 你丈夫在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. Piece of this, piece of that. - Your husband's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.24,0:43:12.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在干什么？- 这是他的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's he doing? - His job.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.97,0:43:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你爸叫你工作？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad got you working, huh? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.59,0:43:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在帮他 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm helping. - Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.26,0:43:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你爸爸在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you happen to know where your dad is?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.97,0:43:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.17,0:43:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Christ's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.47,0:43:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们有任何娱乐的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you have any questions about recreational possibilities,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.09,0:43:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱伦·布迪将乐意为各位解答\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen Brody will be happy to answer them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.55,0:43:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟你说句话 行吗？- 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can I speak to you? - Excuse me a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.30,0:43:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱瑞 我们有些主顾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry, we've got some live ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.55,0:43:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,布迪在暸望塔上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brody's riding his tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.38,0:44:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.01,0:44:07.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不错啊，宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it, sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.80,0:44:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.34,0:44:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这还不够快吗？- 不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This fast enough for you? - No, faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.13,0:44:16.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点儿！- 快点儿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Faster? - Faster!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.76,0:44:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 我爹在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, look! There's my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.05,0:44:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,向我儿子挥手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wave to my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.34,0:44:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.80,0:44:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么把他弄下来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do we get him down from there?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.05,0:44:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许没人注意他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe nobody noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.01,0:44:36.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫他们回到车上吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get them back in the van, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.63,0:44:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.63,0:44:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个人在上面做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that man doing way up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.05,0:44:43.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What man?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.47,0:44:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在观望 在观看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he's watching. You know, a lookout.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.38,0:44:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.28,0:44:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个观鲨塔 我在别处见过 他在观察鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a shark tower. I saw one in Florida. He's looking for sharks.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.57,0:44:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 这是个暸望塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, dear, it's an observation platform.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.65,0:45:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我们的警长 他只不过在观望\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's our chief of police. He's just checking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.11,0:45:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那塔通常用来观鸟 看天气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Normally, it's used for… birdwatching, weather… measurements.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.07,0:45:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,观察自然景色之类…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and nature observation, that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.11,0:45:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱伦 我们的行程有点落后了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Ellen, we're running a little late.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.32,0:45:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.65,0:45:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先上车 然后去参观乡村俱乐部…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we all get on the bus, we could show you the country club…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.37,0:46:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上来！所有的人都离开水面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the water! Out of the water, now! Everybody out!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.41,0:46:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上岸！离开水面！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out! Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.37,0:46:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上岸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.29,0:46:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个笨蛋在搞什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that idiot doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.83,0:46:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody out!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.19,0:46:40.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开水面！快！都上岸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.85,0:46:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,都上岸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone out!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.02,0:46:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上岸！快上岸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the water! Get out of there! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.19,0:46:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开水面！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.56,0:47:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过是蓝鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just bluefish!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.35,0:47:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群蓝鱼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bluefish! Chief, it's a school of bluefish!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.93,0:47:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,只不过是蓝鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just bluefish.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.68,0:47:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 马丁，- 爱伦 没事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Martin? - Ellen, it's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.14,0:47:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别令事情恶化 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's not make it worse, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.35,0:47:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,都过去了 我们去俱乐部吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, it's all over. Let's get back to the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.14,0:48:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.35,0:48:04.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是…误报\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just… It's a false alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.93,0:48:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了 回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.85,0:48:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.89,0:48:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧 没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's go. It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.72,0:50:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莉 现在我不接电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Polly, no calls now, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.93,0:50:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,富加迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fogarty?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.22,0:50:14.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 接过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, put him on.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.39,0:50:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 菲尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Phil?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.02,0:50:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么照片？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.60,0:50:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在开玩笑？我马上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding! I'll be right over.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.31,0:50:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是奥卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah… it's the Orca.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.39,0:50:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好镜头 很快 1- 4\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good lens, too. Fast. 1- 4, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.14,0:50:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 注意到… - 你还有一些吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Notice the fusion… - What else have you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.43,0:50:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今早又冲洗了一些 还没有印出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over here. I exposed some more this morning, I haven't developed 'em yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.81,0:52:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是它 就是它\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. That's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.72,0:52:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,说曹操曹操就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak of the devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.47,0:52:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁，这是个正式会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martin, this is an official meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.89,0:52:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很高兴你们都在 你们看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, I'm glad you're all here. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.89,0:52:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,富加迪刚冲的 从失踪潜水人相机内发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fogarty just developed it. It's from the missing divers' camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.22,0:52:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,海草？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seaweed?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.68,0:52:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.60,0:52:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在水底 难怪这么暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's underwater. That's why it's so dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.89,0:52:47.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不出什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing I can see.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:47.06,0:52:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？你看 是一条鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about? Look at this. That's a shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.14,0:52:54.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看那轮廓 那嘴 眼晴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the outline, the mouth, the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.47,0:52:58.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？对不起 我看不出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what it is? Sorry, I just don't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.27,0:52:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也看不出\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.77,0:53:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁，可以是任何物体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martin, it could be anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.77,0:53:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们以为我不认识鲨鱼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you telling me I don't know what a shark looks like?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.02,0:53:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这什么也不是 镜头里的什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is nothing. Something in the lens.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.93,0:53:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 照的我屁股 - 对 是你的屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lens my ass. - Damn right it's your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.47,0:53:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,理智些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be reasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.85,0:53:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,理智！跟他理智？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reasonable! With him?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.93,0:53:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！你们能不能听听他的意见？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn it, will you just listen to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.64,0:53:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要理智 布迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be reasonable?! Look, Brody,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.35,0:53:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在海滩引起了公众的恐慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}you started a panic on that beach.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.64,0:53:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在那里开枪 会伤及无辜的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shot up the place. God knows who you injured.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.02,0:53:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人控告我们怎么办？你想过了没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if somebody sues us? Did you think about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.60,0:53:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会毁了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could ruin us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.14,0:53:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心会被控告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about being sued.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.31,0:53:38.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果像我认为的那样 这里会空无一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is what I think it is, there won't be anybody here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.93,0:53:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们不要… - 不要什么 莱瑞？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, let's not… - Let's not what, Larry?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.31,0:53:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱瑞 算了 他不会听的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry, let's forget it. He won't listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.22,0:53:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很明显他已认定了 - 我是认定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's obvious he's made up his mind. - You bet I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.56,0:53:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉在座各位 那是条鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you and everybody here, that's a shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.02,0:53:54.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认识鲨鱼 因为我曾近距离见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know because I've seen one up close.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.89,0:53:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们最好采取行动 我再也不想经历一次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you better do something because I won't go through that hell again.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.02,0:54:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁，请等一会儿 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martin, could you wait here for a minute?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.93,0:54:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.85,0:54:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,请先坐一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, just have a seat,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.06,0:54:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们仔细看看照片再作决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}while we look at the picture and make up our own minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.35,0:54:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'll have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.27,0:54:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是值得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what it's worth.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.97,0:54:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.77,0:54:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.77,0:55:04.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:30.47,0:55:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.68,0:55:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在市政厅见到你爸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw your dad over at Town Hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.77,0:55:36.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.35,0:55:39.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的在沙滩上出丑了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he really freak out on the town beach?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.22,0:55:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.10,0:55:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别理他们 都是些废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about them. It's all bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.85,0:55:47.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只不过聚在一起大发缪论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you know this is the only place where the garbage man delivers?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.02,0:55:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 哈 哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ha ha ha.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.81,0:55:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人想去灯塔吗？- 现在？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Anyone wanna go to the lighthouse? - Now?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.81,0:55:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天 或许呆一整天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow. Maybe spend the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.85,0:55:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸在车库留下了几箱啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad left some cases of beer in the garage.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.68,0:56:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还在吗？- 我们可以在船上渡假了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is it still there? - It's kinda vacationing on my boat!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.06,0:56:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 你也去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, are you going to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.43,0:56:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 去 为什么不？- 你可能要在海滩漆厠所！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, why not? - You might be painting toilets!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.85,0:56:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好笑！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.81,0:56:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们去野餐吗？- 对 你带食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we going to have a picnic? - Yeah, you bring the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.35,0:56:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克？- 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mike? - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.35,0:56:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想跟你去灯塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to go to the lighthouse with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.14,0:56:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不敢肯定去不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure I can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.18,0:56:37.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受到限制 我爸不准我用船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm grounded. Dad won't let me use my boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.64,0:56:40.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总听你父母的话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you always do what your parents tell you to?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.18,0:56:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是 - 好 我们明早八点码头见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Good. I'll be at the dock at eight.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.39,0:56:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 八时正\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight o'clock, everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.89,0:57:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what I'd do.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.81,0:57:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？要去参加葬礼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! What is this? A wake for a funeral?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.72,0:57:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你让我们吃惊 - 我一听到就赶来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You surprised us. - I came as soon as I heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.52,0:57:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只不过开除了我 并没有埋葬我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They only fired me, they didn't bury me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.22,0:57:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝贝儿 我回来了 - 我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, baby, I'm home. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.93,0:57:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.85,0:57:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我有东西送给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I've got something for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.68,0:58:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西戴在你身上更适合 因为你很帅气\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will look better on you than me because you're a snappier dresser.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.85,0:58:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 你们在喝佳酿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey! You're drinking the good stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.77,0:58:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,干一杯怎么样？为新警长干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about a toast? A toast to the new chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.02,0:58:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,新警长需要幸运之神的眷顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, the chief's going to need all the luck he can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.52,0:58:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不喝？好 一起喝吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? OK, we'll do it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.93,0:58:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为新警长干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}A toast to the new chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.52,0:58:28.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,为警长欢呼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hail to the chief.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.68,0:58:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝吧！这是你职业的里程碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, drink! This is a milestone in your career.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.27,0:58:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放松 马丁，- 瞧 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ease up, Martin. - Look, Chief,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.93,0:58:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,并不是我不想要你的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}not only don't I want your job,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.06,0:58:49.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来说你是最威大的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I came to tell you I think you're the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.47,0:58:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而我… - 杰夫 没事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I… - Oh, Jeff, it's OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.02,0:58:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我知道这不是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. It's not your fault, I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.72,0:59:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I got to go anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.43,0:59:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你来看我 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for coming by, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.64,0:59:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你实在很帮忙 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've been a big help. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.22,0:59:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 晚安 杰夫 - 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good night, Jeff. - Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.85,0:59:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的韩卓，迟早也会被开除的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor Hendricks. They'll fire his ass, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.39,0:59:23.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着瞧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.72,0:59:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给他们看鲨鱼的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I showed them a picture of that shark.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.60,0:59:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不去看鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.27,0:59:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只看他们想看的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}They see only what they want to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.43,0:59:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但鲨鱼在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's out there, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.89,0:59:40.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是个大傢伙 - 他们因此开除了你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a big mother, too. - Is that why they fired you?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.22,0:59:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.18,0:59:47.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么？沙滩事件？我在现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was it? The beach? I saw what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.52,0:59:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开枪了！开枪了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I blew it. I blew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.02,0:59:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我口没遮挡 枪没遮挡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shot off my mouth. I shot off my gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.10,0:59:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,四年的辛劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four years down the drain.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.39,1:00:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,一枪皆失\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shot to hell.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.81,1:00:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a dummy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.85,1:00:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.18,1:00:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.85,1:00:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前从未被开除过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been fired before.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.06,1:00:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.31,1:00:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我十七岁时有过一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, once when I was 17, when I was a kid, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.64,1:00:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但正式工作从未开除过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But… never from a real job.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.68,1:00:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人说我不胜任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody ever told me I couldn't hack it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.35,1:00:43.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not saying that.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.93,1:00:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, they are.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.60,1:00:49.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.18,1:00:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe they're right.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.52,1:00:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很疲倦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.43,1:00:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,很累\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.72,1:01:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,实在太累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm too damn tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.89,1:01:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝得太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too damn drunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.77,1:01:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在喝得太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you are, too damn drunk.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.14,1:02:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要出去吗？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you going out? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.60,1:02:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要出海吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going sailing?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.81,1:02:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可能吧 - 带我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maybe. - Take me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.72,1:02:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.81,1:02:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想跟你去 轻 - 点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wanna go with you. - Shh! Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.97,1:02:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michael.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.93,1:02:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 来吧 但要轻一点儿！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Come on. But be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.69,1:02:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 丹尼斯 我的至爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Denise, love of my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.98,1:02:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你被关禁闭了 我们做什么？练习？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're grounded, what are we doing? Practice?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.23,1:02:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 练习\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, practice.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.69,1:03:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,为啥在这里？去沙滩吧 我们可以找个姑娘聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are we here and not the beach? We can fool around, pick up some girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.39,1:03:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再碍事我就赶你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're gonna get in the way, go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.02,1:03:10.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没碍事 我碍事吗 安迪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not in the way. Andy, am I in the way?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.48,1:03:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是碍事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're always in the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.39,1:03:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他惹麻烦了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he causing trouble?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.10,1:03:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.31,1:03:18.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以上我的船 - 好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can go out in my boat. - Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.77,1:03:21.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要他？请自便\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want him? You can have him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.31,1:03:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你让某人很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you just made somebody very happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.35,1:03:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 朋友 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi guys. - Hi.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.10,1:03:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 麦克 你要出海？- 我以为你关禁闭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mike, you going out? - I thought you were grounded.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.39,1:03:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想去就能去 - 你能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can go out if I want to. - He can.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.31,1:03:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,船能装得下我们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there enough room for all of us on the boat?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.19,1:03:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不知道 我们… - 肯定能装下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know, we're… - There's plenty of room.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.60,1:03:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜也能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.48,1:03:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,布露？我有地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brooke? I've got room.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.06,1:03:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.44,1:03:49.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你跟我去吗？- 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll go with me? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.56,1:03:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们 我要跟蒂姆出海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks guys, but I'm going with Timmy. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.85,1:03:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.02,1:03:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是个大错误 - 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a big mistake. - Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.56,1:04:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 我已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you guys, I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.35,1:04:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不是说跟我们去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said she was coming with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.44,1:04:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 她不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, obviously, she's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.98,1:04:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你想谈谈此事吗？- 你想游泳回家吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You wanna talk about it? - You wanna swim home?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.39,1:05:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 汤姆！- 尼古拉斯 你应该在上课\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Tom! - Nicholas! You should be in class.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.56,1:05:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个伴侣！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got company!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.48,1:05:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要去捉龙虾 - 好 捉一只给我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm going for lobster. - Great! Bring me one!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.81,1:05:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要用牛油炒的 - 听到吗 汤姆？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want mine with butter. - Got that, Tom?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.27,1:05:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 火鸡\N{\fnArial\fs30}So long, turkeys.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:23.52,1:05:25.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天斯巴凯将带你们潜水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sparky will take you down today.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.02,1:05:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了就下水\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're ready, let's buddy-up and drop.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.85,1:08:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉我们上去！拉我们上去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get us in! For Christ's sake, get us in.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.06,1:08:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,送他上去 保持他的体温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get him in and keep him warm.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.94,1:08:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,送他到甲板上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put him in the forward cabin.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.77,1:08:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看他没事 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be OK. Things'll be OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.31,1:08:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们出发！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.07,1:10:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.66,1:10:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.99,1:10:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回办公室收拾一下办公桌\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I'll go down to the office, clean out the desk,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.41,1:10:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,交还警车\N{\fnArial\fs30}turn in the truck,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.82,1:10:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许会受到你上司的冷言冷语\N{\fnArial\fs30}and maybe get shitfaced and rap your boss in the mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.45,1:10:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也该辞职了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I better give notice.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.20,1:10:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,别太在乎 我们得有收入啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy. We may need the income.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.41,1:10:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.45,1:10:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他近来一直早出 已经习惯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's making out early these days, must be a morning man.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.20,1:10:52.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,像他父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like his father.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.74,1:11:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 有什么特别的事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning. Anything special today?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.58,1:11:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 尚出去玩了 他喜欢去哪里就去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Sean's out somewhere. Let him have whatever he wants.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.87,1:11:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但别让他吃糖果 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just keep him away from the candy. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.95,1:11:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我还可以搭便车吗？- 嗯嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do I still get my ride? - Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.58,1:11:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你修水管的弟弟 来修修楼上的水槽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call your brother, the plumber, that sink upstairs is screwed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.87,1:11:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰？他是我表弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankie? He's my cousin.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.28,1:11:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,问他需要学徒工吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask if he can use an apprentice.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.37,1:11:23.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.29,1:11:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想让它这个样子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to just leave her pointing up?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.95,1:11:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.75,1:12:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 这里不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}There we go. Yeah, this is fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.20,1:12:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是要扬帆吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about sailing?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.91,1:12:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.66,1:12:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我们会扬帆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you worry. We're gonna make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.12,1:12:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不小心 你会漂到布达佩斯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll make it to Budapest if you're not careful!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.91,1:12:12.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what about the others?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.79,1:12:15.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他的人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about them?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.12,1:12:17.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到时 他们定会在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be there when we get there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.45,1:12:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会点起篝火 海货 酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll have their bonfire, clams, liquor…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.41,1:12:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.75,1:12:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在做什么呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we gonna do in the meantime?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.58,1:12:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在来想一下儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, in the meantime, we'll have to think of something.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.04,1:12:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.62,1:12:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.04,1:12:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿毯子出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out the blanket.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.83,1:12:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我的屁股脏了 我妈妈会不高兴的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got black marks all over my butt and mom's getting uptight about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.12,1:12:47.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.00,1:12:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,毯子来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out with the blanket.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.99,1:12:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的需要毯子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really need a blanket?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.78,1:12:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need one!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.79,1:13:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿 你的毯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well… here's your blanket.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.01,1:13:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿迪！救命呀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie! Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.84,1:13:22.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.09,1:13:24.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪娜！- 救救我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tina! - Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.68,1:13:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪娜！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tina!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.59,1:13:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh… Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.76,1:13:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿迪 快游！有鲨鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, swim! Swim fast, it's a shark, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.80,1:14:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,游啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swim!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.09,1:14:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 阿迪！快点游！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Eddie, swim!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.67,1:14:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点游！快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swim faster! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.26,1:14:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快点游！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Swim!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.44,1:14:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿迪！是条鲨鱼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, Eddie. It's a shark!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.11,1:14:21.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿迪 快！快！快游！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, hurry! Faster! Come on. Swim!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.03,1:14:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 阿迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry! Hurry, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.74,1:14:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.20,1:14:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tina…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.45,1:15:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，妈呀…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mama…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.53,1:15:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶它走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please make it go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:11.99,1:15:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶它走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.07,1:15:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶它走！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it go away!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.78,1:15:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不是你的职责了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey, it's not your job any more.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.95,1:15:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想过去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanna look.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.62,1:15:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 驶开！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get out of there! Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.95,1:16:22.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他怎么了？- 血栓 血里有气泡\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened to him? - Embolism. Air bubbles in the blood.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.20,1:16:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他上升的速度太快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came up too fast, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.83,1:16:26.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定在水底受惊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something must have scared him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.79,1:16:28.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是受了惊吓\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just panicked.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.62,1:16:31.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我们会好好照顾他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry, we're taking good care of him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.75,1:16:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样会这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.54,1:16:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,被咬伤的 像痉挛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bite reflex, like a spasm.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:43.20,1:16:45.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在孩子出海后\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happened after the kids went out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.79,1:16:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么孩子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kids?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.70,1:16:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,小云汉 布露 杰克 麦克…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Junior Vaughan, Brookie Peters, Jackie, Mike…
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.83,1:16:53.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的麦克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our Mike?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:53.54,1:16:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要去灯塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're headed for the lighthouse. Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.16,1:17:12.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,警长 你已经不是警长了 我不能让你驾船出海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Chief, you're not chief now. I can't let you take her out.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.37,1:17:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,布迪太太 你也不能出海\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Brody, look, you can't go. Neither one of you can go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.04,1:17:18.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 捡起那个绳索 - 麦克在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get that line. - Mike is out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.37,1:17:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我签收这条船了 布迪太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I signed for the boat. Mrs Brody, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.71,1:17:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！警长 你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit! Chief, go on up to the bow, you're doing that wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.96,1:17:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,应去船头 解船头缆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead, untie the bowline.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.12,1:17:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不会开除俩人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can't fire both of us, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.54,1:17:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,总得有个管事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody's got to be in charge.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:33.50,1:17:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你想去哪个方向？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, which direction do you wanna go?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.96,1:17:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说过灯塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said something about a lighthouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.71,1:17:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.04,1:18:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿米堤呼叫海港巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amity Launch to Harbour Patrol.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.29,1:18:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是海港巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Harbour Patrol.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.04,1:18:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,能否安排一架直升机？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, do you think you can raise me a chopper?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.42,1:18:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是布迪吗？暂时不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that you Brody? Not right away.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.08,1:18:11.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,它正在检察浮标\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's out checking a buoy.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.13,1:18:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知它前往灯塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it out to the lighthouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.17,1:18:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些孩子去了那里 要将他们接回海港\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's some kids sailing out there. I want them back in port.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:17.04,1:18:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 将孩子接回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Affirmative. Turn the kids back to port.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.59,1:18:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,巡逻队话毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you. Patrol out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.36,1:18:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,布迪话毕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brody out.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.94,1:18:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点儿 笨蛋 你们落后了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up, suckers, you're dragging!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.23,1:18:49.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们越过灯塔吧 我知道个好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, let's go past the lighthouse. I know a better spot. Come about.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.28,1:18:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.66,1:20:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抓到了 警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it, Chief.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:53.90,1:20:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.69,1:20:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.77,1:21:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.69,1:21:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.90,1:21:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.30,1:21:09.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.38,1:21:13.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.38,1:21:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪娜 迪娜…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tina, Tina…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.46,1:21:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪娜！… 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tina, it's OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.21,1:21:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它还在那里 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's still there. - What is?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.34,1:21:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么还在那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's still there?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.05,1:21:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲨 鲨 鲨 鲨…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sh-sh-sh-sh…
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.84,1:21:30.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲨鱼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shark!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.09,1:21:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's still there.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.72,1:22:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条船会送你回去 他们去哪里了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That boat will take you in. Where the hell are they?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.17,1:22:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,右弦十度 朝着沙丘…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten degrees off your starboard. Take a heading…
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.38,1:22:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,废话！指出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that shit! Point!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:06.97,1:22:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}There.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.17,1:22:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.51,1:22:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,克里斯芬先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Christian! Mr Christian!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.93,1:22:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,给这个船充充气 刮掉可笑的胡子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pump up this boat! And shave off that dreadful moustache.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.13,1:22:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,英格兰希望每个人尽职 准备好就开火！\N{\fnArial\fs30}England expects every man to do his duty. Fire when ready!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.84,1:22:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的鱼雷！全速前进！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn the torpedoes! Full speed ahead!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.01,1:22:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,最光荣的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will be our finest hour.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.68,1:22:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.47,1:22:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 有人刺破了你的气球？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bligh, someone pop your balloon?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.30,1:22:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}No problem, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.01,1:23:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,保持平衡！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balance the boat!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.64,1:23:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.64,1:23:51.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,做点儿什么！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do something!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.47,1:23:58.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒂姆！布露！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Timmy! Brooke!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.06,1:24:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Look out.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.47,1:24:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.35,1:24:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把我带走！- 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get me out of here! - I'll get you out.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.64,1:24:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱瑞！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.89,1:24:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱瑞！转！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry! Turn!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.72,1:24:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,转！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.10,1:24:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.10,1:24:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快！- 快帮麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry up! - Mike's out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:30.56,1:24:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the water.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:36.68,1:24:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来帮麦克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody look out for Mike!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.98,1:24:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住点儿东西！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on to something!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.48,1:24:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克 过来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike, get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.10,1:24:48.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.10,1:24:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.73,1:24:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,麦克！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.64,1:24:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,布迪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brody!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.77,1:25:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.81,1:25:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓住胳膊 - 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get his arm. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.77,1:25:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他的外衣！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull his jacket!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.98,1:25:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉上来 它来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him clear, it's coming up.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.90,1:25:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快！快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.81,1:25:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.44,1:26:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他流了很多血\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's bleeding pretty bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.06,1:26:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要送麦克去见医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get Mike to a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.65,1:26:09.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的船能开吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you sail?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:09.40,1:26:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,能 让他进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We'll take him in.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:11.65,1:26:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 快去找援兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. Get some help here fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.40,1:26:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.02,1:26:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来收拾这个残局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's wrap this mess up.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.52,1:26:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它扔给布露\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw this to Brooke.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.69,1:26:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,布露 接住，再抛给马克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brooke, get this and throw it to Mark.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.98,1:26:46.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,马克 接住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:46.73,1:26:49.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它绑在船桅上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tie a bowline around your mast.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.40,1:26:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:53.98,1:26:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, pull.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.78,1:26:57.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道能否支持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if it'll hold.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.78,1:26:59.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 把船垫装上\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Someone put a fender up.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.03,1:27:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以用另一手\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could use another hand on this.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.40,1:27:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 尽管拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy. Just pull.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.40,1:27:07.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,绑好它 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tie it off. All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.74,1:27:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿米堤号呼叫空中巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amity Launch to Air Patrol One.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.74,1:27:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿米堤号呼叫空中巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amity Launch to Air Patrol One.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.07,1:27:47.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:47.78,1:27:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是空中巡逻 你是布迪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}'This is Air Patrol. That you, Brody?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.45,1:27:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你找到孩子的位置了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Do you have a fix on those kids?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.53,1:27:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我仍在搜索\N{\fnArial\fs30}Negative. I'm still down.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:55.40,1:27:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要尽快呀 他们孤立无援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell up because I'm out here alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.90,1:28:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,布迪 我要调校频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brody, I got to switch frequencies.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.20,1:28:04.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,通知我上司 我在法兰斯浅滩与你会合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call my boss. I'll meet you by Francis Shoal. Out.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.86,1:28:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,法兰斯浅滩？在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Francis Shoal? Where the hell is Francis Shoal?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.62,1:28:25.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.70,1:28:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我孤军作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all alone out here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:09.41,1:29:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有谁要玩游戏吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone want to play charades?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.66,1:29:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.83,1:29:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只需到电缆塔等候就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we have to do is land at Cable Junction and wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.08,1:29:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个破船怎么能漂过去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How will we do that on this garbage?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.62,1:29:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了电缆塔是什么地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's after Cable Junction?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.91,1:29:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,大西洋 然后是爱尔兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Atlantic. Then Ireland.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.87,1:29:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 我肚子饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.41,1:30:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,海港巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Air Patrol to Base.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.41,1:30:12.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,空中巡逻呼叫基地 已发现那班航海者的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a positive location on that sailing party.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.29,1:30:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,船被损 在海中漂浮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Disabled and adrift,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.58,1:30:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约在电缆塔以西四分之三里\N{\fnArial\fs30}about three quarters of a mile west of Cable Junction,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.25,1:30:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,风浪将他们吹向东面\N{\fnArial\fs30}wind and tide carrying them due east.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.21,1:31:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家怎么样？有人受伤了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is everyone OK? Is anybody hurt?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.42,1:31:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.58,1:31:14.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会拖你们前往电缆塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tow you to Cable Junction,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:15.00,1:31:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后通知海防队\N{\fnArial\fs30}then call the Coast Guard.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.67,1:31:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,扔根绳子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw me a line.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.71,1:31:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张 可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.21,1:31:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 啊，倒霉的一天 - 好了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, what a day - Here you go!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.63,1:31:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.17,1:31:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抓住点儿东西 - 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, hold on to something. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.83,1:31:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快！- 最好快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry up! - Better hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.80,1:33:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.43,1:33:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尚 - 尚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sean! - Sean!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.93,1:33:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.72,1:33:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.43,1:33:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,快拉他上船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him in the boat.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.39,1:34:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尚 - 快！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sean! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:02.01,1:34:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,上船！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get aboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.43,1:34:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快！- 来啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry! - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:08.59,1:34:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:15.43,1:34:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我站不起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get up.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.76,1:34:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.30,1:34:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.05,1:34:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,送她到医院后来我办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her to the hospital and meet me at the office.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.30,1:34:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,要明白我的处境…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to understand my position…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.55,1:34:43.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪娜不会有事 你没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tina will be all right. Are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.43,1:34:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱伦 对不起 相信我 真的对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ellen, I'm sorry. Believe me, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.30,1:34:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只在想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was only thinking of…
Dialogue: 0,1:34:50.10,1:34:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不管你想什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't give a damn what you think.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:52.39,1:34:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只知道死了一个孩子 而我儿子和丈夫仍在海上\N{\fnArial\fs30}A boy is dead and my son and husband are still out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.99,1:35:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿米堤号呼叫海港巡逻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amity Launch to Harbour Patrol.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.57,1:35:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿米堤号呼叫海港…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amity Launch to Harbour…
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.12,1:35:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈的！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.28,1:36:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚 抓住绳索！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean, catch the rope!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.82,1:36:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 绳索！- 尚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, the rope! - Sean!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.99,1:36:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚！抓住绳索！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean, catch the rope!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:12.69,1:36:14.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚 绳索！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean, the rope!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.53,1:36:18.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来 尚！- 来 尚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Sean! - Come on, Sean!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.40,1:36:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:19.99,1:36:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.15,1:36:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚 抓住绳索！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean, catch the rope!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.10,1:36:24.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,绳子！尚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rope, Sean!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:24.20,1:36:25.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来！尚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sean!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.81,1:36:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要人帮忙 否则不会成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! You've gotta help or it won't work.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.60,1:36:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能否住嘴？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you stop?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.36,1:36:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 醒醒 尚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sean, wake up!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.48,1:36:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,捡起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.90,1:36:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.27,1:36:42.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚！该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean, goddamn it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:42.11,1:36:45.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚！听着 否则踢烂你的屁股\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean, listen to me or I'll break your ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:49.65,1:36:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.44,1:36:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 尚 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, Sean, now listen.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:54.69,1:36:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将绳索抛给你 你抓住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll throw you this rope and you better catch it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.06,1:36:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚 准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean, you ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:59.81,1:37:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了 小朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here it comes, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.27,1:37:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,接住！尚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it, Sean.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:08.11,1:37:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚！接住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean, get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.40,1:37:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 接住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:12.73,1:37:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 把它绑在甲板上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Now tie it around the centreboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.36,1:37:18.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,绑紧点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tie it tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.82,1:37:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ready? Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:22.44,1:37:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.82,1:37:25.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住，好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on, OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.61,1:37:27.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了 抓紧点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we go. Hold on tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.32,1:37:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:41.48,1:37:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.73,1:37:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.40,1:37:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.61,1:37:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救他上来！- 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get him out! - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.40,1:38:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Are you OK, kid?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.69,1:38:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为失去了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we lost you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.24,1:38:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,电缆塔就在前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cable Junction's ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:19.94,1:38:22.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们能到达那里吗？- 不知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can we make it? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:22.36,1:38:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是问问 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, I was just asking! - I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:27.86,1:38:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么样了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's she doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.57,1:38:31.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,要保持她的体温\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just got to keep her warm.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:34.86,1:38:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来帮忙 我可以开动它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody help me and we could steer this.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.82,1:38:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还指望能开船？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you playing with a tube for?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.28,1:38:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果我们… - 闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If everyone… - Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:43.32,1:38:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我不能不去想！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry but I can't stop thinking about this!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:46.45,1:38:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好不要！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you better try!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:48.07,1:38:50.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝 请帮帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, please help.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.11,1:38:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.95,1:38:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,圣母玛利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy Mary,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.82,1:38:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶稣之母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother of Christ,
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.82,1:38:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,请救救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}please help us.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:01.57,1:39:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,请帮帮我们.\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please help us.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.78,1:39:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们乞求\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're begging.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:10.82,1:39:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,请拯救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please save us.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:15.25,1:40:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢耶稣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank Christ.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.70,1:40:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,将它绑在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take that back to the cleat.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.83,1:40:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么啦？- 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - I'm OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.20,1:40:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真没事？- 鲨鱼袭击了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure? - A shark hit us.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.87,1:40:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean's out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.87,1:40:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 他要来 没事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - He wanted to come.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.45,1:40:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:44.83,1:40:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在电缆塔附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're in the current heading for Cable Junction.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.62,1:40:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 到灯塔上等我 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, get to the lighthouse and stay there, OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.29,1:40:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 呆在那里 - 对不起 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay there. - I'm sorry, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.04,1:40:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别提了 只管去灯塔吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it. Just get to the lighthouse.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.46,1:41:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们快到了 - 我看不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're almost there. - It's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.12,1:41:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快转 往左\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, more to port.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:11.78,1:41:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续前进 我们定会成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it going. We'll make it.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.33,1:41:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,往左 该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}More to port, goddamn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:17.37,1:41:19.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the way over.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.29,1:41:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱瑞 我们能登上岛吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Larry, are we going to make it to the island?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:24.08,1:41:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're steering for it, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:27.37,1:41:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但风从侧面吹来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the wind drift is lateral.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.41,1:41:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.96,1:41:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,意思是我们偏离航道 我们往那里漂去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means that we're going sideways. We're going that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.46,1:41:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但我们正朝目标前进 - 现在不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We were heading right for it. - Not now.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.12,1:41:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死！该死！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. Shit, shit, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:51.54,1:41:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 别划水了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! Stop paddling.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.67,1:41:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为什么上岛？- 鲨鱼！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the island? - The shark!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.04,1:42:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 我想我们搁浅了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's happening? - I think we're stuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:25.08,1:42:27.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看是海底\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:27.21,1:42:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 是它 - 是海底\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's that thing. - It's just the bottom.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:29.96,1:42:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是海底 是它！他要吃了我们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it's not the bottom. It's that thing! It's gonna kill us!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.00,1:42:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰凯 闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jackie, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.50,1:42:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不！它要吃了我们！- 闭嘴！闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! It's going to kill us! - Shut up! Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.59,1:42:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开她！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave her alone!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:42.34,1:42:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你去照顾她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.38,1:42:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她歇斯底里 打… - 坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's hysterical, beating… - Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:47.42,1:42:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,肃静！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.30,1:42:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 闭嘴！- 听着！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shut up! - Listen!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.36,1:42:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她不是瞎说 - 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She shouldn't freak out. - Listen!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.13,1:43:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听到了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hear it?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.09,1:43:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那边！朝我们这里来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there! It's coming towards us.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:19.38,1:43:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是爸爸！爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Dad! Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:28.51,1:43:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.17,1:43:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,冷静 来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, cool. Cool, come on…
Dialogue: 0,1:44:10.30,1:44:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉自己过来 我们离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull yourselves over and we'll get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.51,1:44:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 我们被卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't. We're stuck on the bottom here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.30,1:44:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我靠近点儿你们就能登船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get you closer. We'll come aboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.18,1:44:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 侧面靠近 - 快点！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pull us alongside. - Please hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.26,1:44:23.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 稳住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, hold it steady.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.80,1:44:26.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 鲨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sh…!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.72,1:44:38.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.09,1:44:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:58.14,1:45:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 你们别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm all right. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.98,1:45:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,救生筏
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.30,1:45:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着它 我帮你们过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, take this and I'll get you over.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:18.30,1:45:20.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 绑好它 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, tie it on. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.10,1:45:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 将绳子穿过环\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, pull these hooks over with the rope.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.51,1:45:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后固定在筏子上 我用绞车拉你们过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secure them to the raft then I'll pull you back with the winch, OK?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.85,1:45:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:07.16,1:46:09.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 可以拉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, pull it over.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:22.33,1:46:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's stuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:23.83,1:46:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我开倒车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute, I'll put… I'll put it in reverse.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.75,1:47:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:13.17,1:47:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西！小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy, look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.33,1:47:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊！不！不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:22.67,1:47:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucy!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.21,1:47:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.96,1:47:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，上帝！不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:38.58,1:47:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.71,1:47:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要动！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.57,1:48:09.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（高压 不得靠近）
Dialogue: 0,1:48:12.92,1:48:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.13,1:48:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:23.54,1:48:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:28.71,1:48:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:44.50,1:48:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.71,1:48:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,尚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sean!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:54.76,1:49:57.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它在哪里？- 它在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where'd he go? - Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.26,1:50:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在那里！- 在那里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There he is! - Over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.84,1:50:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:42.97,1:50:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:44.89,1:50:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,它正向你游去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's heading right for you!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:52.23,1:50:54.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！杂种！\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you big bastard, come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.16,1:50:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个礼物要送给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got something for you now.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.66,1:51:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it! That a boy! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:04.62,1:51:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这里！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:06.07,1:51:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.74,1:51:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:09.91,1:51:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.87,1:51:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,别那样！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.49,1:51:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开！走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:19.95,1:51:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸！小心呀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.91,1:51:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:22.99,1:51:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.95,1:51:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,张开大嘴吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open wide!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:26.45,1:51:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,张开大嘴吧！说「啊」！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open wide, say "ah"!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:00.24,1:52:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他成功了 他成功了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did it. He got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.00,1:52:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他成功了！成功了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did it! He did it! He did it!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.58,1:52:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见吗？它死了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he get it? It's dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:34.25,1:52:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,它死了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:45.91,1:52:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊，谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.87,1:52:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 谢谢… 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, thank you, thank you…
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.29,1:53:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你呢… - 是他们要我出海的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you… - They made me go with them.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:14.01,1:53:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure they did!
